(6813654, 1024710, 118154, '<td valign="top">Neat shot.</td>', 'Neat shot.', '2012-07-09 14:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813681, 1024983, 10785, '<td valign="top">Perfect outline of light and the blue and grey are nice together!! Great repeating pattern and symmetry! Just a touch off of symmetrical on either edge...</td>', 'Perfect outline of light and the blue and grey are nice together!! Great repeating pattern and symmetry! Just a touch off of symmetrical on either edge...', '2012-07-09 14:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813684, 1024932, 10785, '<td valign="top">The little swath of light is awesome. What''s great about this image is the control. You blocked a lot of info out and added in only what was needed to be shown. What''s missing is the sharpness!</td>', 'The little swath of light is awesome. What''s great about this image is the control. You blocked a lot of info out and added in only what was needed to be shown. What''s missing is the sharpness!', '2012-07-09 14:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813685, 1024999, 10785, '<td valign="top">Lot''s of grain here looks to be from tonemapping and high ISO. The tones are coming out more brown than speia, but that is to taste. I think there are still a lot of dust marks and spots on the glass that could have been dealt with in post.</td>', 'Lot''s of grain here looks to be from tonemapping and high ISO. The tones are coming out more brown than speia, but that is to taste. I think there are still a lot of dust marks and spots on the glass that could have been dealt with in post.', '2012-07-09 14:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813686, 1024918, 10785, '<td valign="top">Just a touch underexposed. It seems as though the berry needs a bit of contrast.</td>', 'Just a touch underexposed. It seems as though the berry needs a bit of contrast.', '2012-07-09 14:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813691, 1024863, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great sunset lighting here! The dark background at the bottom serves to clutter up the shot. There''s lots of room at the top and the corner vignetting doesn''t act to create a real good focal point as it is too small to force my view to the subject. You did get wonderful color along with good highlights and shadows.</td>', 'Great sunset lighting here! The dark background at the bottom serves to clutter up the shot. There''s lots of room at the top and the corner vignetting doesn''t act to create a real good focal point as it is too small to force my view to the subject. You did get wonderful color along with good highlights and shadows.', '2012-07-09 14:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813695, 1025020, 10785, '<td valign="top">Love the vintage processing. The tones are good and the noise adds to the ambiance. The glass bottles all look curved which appears to be an effect of the lens. Also the light at the bottom right, or the lack thereof, takes away from the background spotlight you were going for.</td>', 'Love the vintage processing. The tones are good and the noise adds to the ambiance. The glass bottles all look curved which appears to be an effect of the lens. Also the light at the bottom right, or the lack thereof, takes away from the background spotlight you were going for.', '2012-07-09 14:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813698, 1024636, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice use of lens flare. And good that you kept your reflection out of the glass. I think the processing makes this a little to middle toned without creating separation between the background and the subject. Also there is some dust on the glass that can be dealt with in post with the healing brush. I am loving the two sparkling highlights on the rim!</td>', 'Nice use of lens flare. And good that you kept your reflection out of the glass. I think the processing makes this a little to middle toned without creating separation between the background and the subject. Also there is some dust on the glass that can be dealt with in post with the healing brush. I am loving the two sparkling highlights on the rim!', '2012-07-09 15:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813702, 1024955, 10785, '<td valign="top">Perhaps isolating the glass door and removing the cluttered area on the left would have helped keep this shot clean and simple.</td>', 'Perhaps isolating the glass door and removing the cluttered area on the left would have helped keep this shot clean and simple.', '2012-07-09 15:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813707, 1024925, 10785, '<td valign="top">I know this is straight up and down because I used the side of the browser window to check the stem for straightness, but somehow there is an optical illusion that this glass is leaning leftward. (Perhaps it is off by a tenth of a degree or so.) The reference to older pop culture is funny but may be lost by most international viewers.</td>', 'I know this is straight up and down because I used the side of the browser window to check the stem for straightness, but somehow there is an optical illusion that this glass is leaning leftward. (Perhaps it is off by a tenth of a degree or so.) The reference to older pop culture is funny but may be lost by most international viewers.', '2012-07-09 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813708, 1024864, 10785, '<td valign="top">A majestic building with lovely sunset color. I think this could be made brighter because it is coming off rather dark.</td>', 'A majestic building with lovely sunset color. I think this could be made brighter because it is coming off rather dark.', '2012-07-09 15:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813719, 1024710, 10785, '<td valign="top">There''s no way to improve on this!! None.</td>', 'There''s no way to improve on this!! None.', '2012-07-09 15:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813745, 1024918, 99263, '<td valign="top">Cool idea,well set up and executed with an eye-pleasing pleasing result. You should have cropped the same amount on the right as on the left though imo.7</td>', 'Cool idea,well set up and executed with an eye-pleasing pleasing result. You should have cropped the same amount on the right as on the left though imo.7', '2012-07-09 16:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
