(6813772, 1024839, 43774, '<td valign="top">Irene? Love the colours here. Wish I knew how to get coloured backgrounds- I can usually only manage a white background with glass.</td>', 'Irene? Love the colours here. Wish I knew how to get coloured backgrounds- I can usually only manage a white background with glass.', '2012-07-09 16:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813773, 1025011, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and the curve of the building. Good colours too.</td>', 'I like the perspective and the curve of the building. Good colours too.', '2012-07-09 16:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813774, 1024488, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very cute but doesn''t say glass to me, sorry.</td>', 'Very cute but doesn''t say glass to me, sorry.', '2012-07-09 16:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813775, 1024710, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love this building, how cool!</td>', 'Love this building, how cool!', '2012-07-09 16:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813777, 1024046, 43774, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why but it reminds me of frogs legs.</td>', 'I don''t know why but it reminds me of frogs legs.', '2012-07-09 16:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813778, 1025016, 43774, '<td valign="top">Jello? Cute!</td>', 'Jello? Cute!', '2012-07-09 16:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813783, 1024883, 43774, '<td valign="top">Neat glasses, I saw those and had to resist buying them, they were too expensive!</td>', 'Neat glasses, I saw those and had to resist buying them, they were too expensive!', '2012-07-09 16:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813825, 1024661, 2279, '<td valign="top">Great shot with great colors and clarity. I only wish that the entire glass and bottle were visible. Its a little too close of a crop for me. 7.</td>', 'Great shot with great colors and clarity. I only wish that the entire glass and bottle were visible. Its a little too close of a crop for me. 7.', '2012-07-09 17:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813826, 1025020, 2279, '<td valign="top">I like the grainy-ness but the crop seems tight at the bottom. I would have left a little breathing room for the bottles underneath and maybe a tiny bit more at the top.</td>', 'I like the grainy-ness but the crop seems tight at the bottom. I would have left a little breathing room for the bottles underneath and maybe a tiny bit more at the top.', '2012-07-09 17:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813829, 1024950, 2279, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t appear to have a real focal point. Its clear and the lines are nice but don''t seem balanced. The clear part has more detail and is larger which gives it a lot of hierarcy and the small dark black area seems too small to balance properly.</td>', 'This doesn''t appear to have a real focal point. Its clear and the lines are nice but don''t seem balanced. The clear part has more detail and is larger which gives it a lot of hierarcy and the small dark black area seems too small to balance properly.', '2012-07-09 17:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813831, 1024771, 137320, '<td valign="top">I scored this an 8 and have a bit of a tough time explaining why. It was my gut reaction to the image, so it undoubtedly deserves it. I know like the sharp lines, I like the rule of thirds with 3 different textures. The small light in the background on the right is a perfect counter to the light in the foreground on the left. Not sure how many of these things were intentional lol, but this is my highest rated image of the challenge nonetheless. Keep up the good work.</td>', 'I scored this an 8 and have a bit of a tough time explaining why. It was my gut reaction to the image, so it undoubtedly deserves it. I know like the sharp lines, I like the rule of thirds with 3 different textures. The small light in the background on the right is a perfect counter to the light in the foreground on the left. Not sure how many of these things were intentional lol, but this is my highest rated image of the challenge nonetheless. Keep up the good work.', '2012-07-09 17:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813833, 1024929, 137320, '<td valign="top">Not wildly original, not an extraordinary capture necessarily, not a giant fan of the bottom left being so dark almost creating a half vignette... HOWEVER this is probably my favorite image of the challenge. The colors are very pleasing and work well together. The smoothness of the globe right above the strong metal texture below it, and the sharp focus in the center with the rest of the image giving off a soft focus, almost mystical feel. I don''t know how well this will do, but I know I love this, and scored it a 9.</td>', 'Not wildly original, not an extraordinary capture necessarily, not a giant fan of the bottom left being so dark almost creating a half vignette... HOWEVER this is probably my favorite image of the challenge. The colors are very pleasing and work well together. The smoothness of the globe right above the strong metal texture below it, and the sharp focus in the center with the rest of the image giving off a soft focus, almost mystical feel. I don''t know how well this will do, but I know I love this, and scored it a 9.', '2012-07-09 17:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813836, 1024388, 137320, '<td valign="top">A very cool image with a LOT of potential! I would have loved to see a bit more done with the colors and lighting. Color wise, maybe play with the greens a bit to give this a bit more life. For the lighting, I see there is a diagonal line going down the image separating the dark from the light, maybe use a little dodge/burn or put a levels mask on it to exaggerate that a bit more. Overall one of my faves, I scored it an 8 and expect it to do very well!</td>', 'A very cool image with a LOT of potential! I would have loved to see a bit more done with the colors and lighting. Color wise, maybe play with the greens a bit to give this a bit more life. For the lighting, I see there is a diagonal line going down the image separating the dark from the light, maybe use a little dodge/burn or put a levels mask on it to exaggerate that a bit more. Overall one of my faves, I scored it an 8 and expect it to do very well!', '2012-07-09 17:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813837, 1024710, 137320, '<td valign="top">A very clever idea and take on the challenge. High marks from me, well done!</td>', 'A very clever idea and take on the challenge. High marks from me, well done!', '2012-07-09 17:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813839, 1024859, 137320, '<td valign="top">Was a little torn on this one. It''s not quite low key it seems, so maybe could have used a slight adjustment to pure white (maybe 244ish?) to give it a bit more pop. Nice use of shadows, blacks are very nice and I love the focus. A cool image for sure, I scored it a 7. :)</td>', 'Was a little torn on this one. It''s not quite low key it seems, so maybe could have used a slight adjustment to pure white (maybe 244ish?) to give it a bit more pop. Nice use of shadows, blacks are very nice and I love the focus. A cool image for sure, I scored it a 7. :)', '2012-07-09 17:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813843, 1024867, 137320, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Sharp. Elegant. 8 :)</td>', 'Stunning. Sharp. Elegant. 8 :)', '2012-07-09 17:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813846, 1024986, 137320, '<td valign="top">This is a superb image. Probably my favorite I''ve seen in this "genre" in quite a long time. Well done!</td>', 'This is a superb image. Probably my favorite I''ve seen in this "genre" in quite a long time. Well done!', '2012-07-09 17:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813848, 1024867, 2279, '<td valign="top">The focal point is obviously the large circular design, but i wish it was displayed in a more pleasing manner. It just looks like you pointed at the circle and took the photo. Even at this distance its hard to see detail in the glass so its up to our imagination to fill in the blanks, with that in mind I would have stepped back to show how it fit in with the rest of the building and let us imagine away.</td>', 'The focal point is obviously the large circular design, but i wish it was displayed in a more pleasing manner. It just looks like you pointed at the circle and took the photo. Even at this distance its hard to see detail in the glass so its up to our imagination to fill in the blanks, with that in mind I would have stepped back to show how it fit in with the rest of the building and let us imagine away.', '2012-07-09 17:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813849, 1024839, 2279, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and crop of this photo. The red and blue remind me of energy and then I almost think that the glass is spinning in the background. Great shot.</td>', 'I love the colors and crop of this photo. The red and blue remind me of energy and then I almost think that the glass is spinning in the background. Great shot.', '2012-07-09 17:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813851, 1024859, 2279, '<td valign="top">Very simple and elegant looking. Great focus, the lighting is spot on and the board fading into the background looks awesome. Should rank pretty high this week.</td>', 'Very simple and elegant looking. Great focus, the lighting is spot on and the board fading into the background looks awesome. Should rank pretty high this week.', '2012-07-09 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813852, 1024971, 137320, '<td valign="top">Really wanted to like this. I definitely like the very dark/low key feel to it. I''m afraid it''s just too dark to make out much.</td>', 'Really wanted to like this. I definitely like the very dark/low key feel to it. I''m afraid it''s just too dark to make out much.', '2012-07-09 18:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813854, 1024883, 2279, '<td valign="top">Would have loved to see these overlapping somehow reminding us that even with fact and fiction there may be some middle / grey area. Great use of colors and balance. Even the background looks well lit.</td>', 'Would have loved to see these overlapping somehow reminding us that even with fact and fiction there may be some middle / grey area. Great use of colors and balance. Even the background looks well lit.', '2012-07-09 18:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6813856, 1024956, 2279, '<td valign="top">Nice pleasing use of colors and composition. The window bars help to frame the glasses in the foreground and the background bokeh looks great.</td>', 'Nice pleasing use of colors and composition. The window bars help to frame the glasses in the foreground and the background bokeh looks great.', '2012-07-09 18:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
