(6816232, 1025021, 62249, '<td valign="top">You seem to be going for some kind of grunge look, but the image doesn''t tell any kind of story. Why would a measuring cup be in a grungy environment? Your image doesn''t provide any clues. The composition doesn''t provide interest either because you''ve given equal weight to the foreground and the background.</td>', 'You seem to be going for some kind of grunge look, but the image doesn''t tell any kind of story. Why would a measuring cup be in a grungy environment? Your image doesn''t provide any clues. The composition doesn''t provide interest either because you''ve given equal weight to the foreground and the background.', '2012-07-12 13:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
