(6822491, 1024949, 60495, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Spork99:</b></div><hr/><i> I was your 10, I think you were robbed. <br/> <br/>Anyway, I believe that''s a bottle drying rack. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks, I appreciate your comment and am glad you enjoyed the image. You are probably right about it being a drying rack, it is currently being used as a display at a store thus the price tags on the bottles. If there would have been less clutter behind and around the rack I would have liked to include the entire rack and all the bottles but settled in a small section.</td>', 'Originally posted by Spork99: I was your 10, I think you were robbed.  Anyway, I believe that''s a bottle drying rack.   Thanks, I appreciate your comment and am glad you enjoyed the image. You are probably right about it being a drying rack, it is currently being used as a display at a store thus the price tags on the bottles. If there would have been less clutter behind and around the rack I would have liked to include the entire rack and all the bottles but settled in a small section.', '2012-07-20 12:17:53.000000', NULL, 0),
